{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/general-onyx-path-discussion/storypath-system/1541518-storypath-ultra-core-on-backerkit","id":1541518,"title":"Storypath Ultra Core on Backerkit!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","General Onyx Path Discussion","Storypath System"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-09-04T00:53:56-07:00","id":1541518,"title":"Storypath Ultra Core on Backerkit!","content":"Right now have <b>Storypath Ultra Core</b> crowdfunding on Backerkit! <a href=\"https://www.backerkit.com/c/projects/onyx-path/storypath-ultra-rules-manual/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.backerkit.com/c/projects...-rules-manual/</a><br /> <br /> for now we got Basic Rules chapter. Backers will also vote on the two example settings added - one is S-F, other we do not know now.<br /> <br /> <b>Here is rundown on shared Manuscript Previews dates:</b><br /> Storypath Ultra Draft Manuscript Preview 1 - Core System NOW<br /> Storypath Ultra Draft Manuscript Preview 2 - Expansion - Coming Sept 8<br /> Storypath Ultra Draft Manuscript Preview 3 - Building Blocks - Coming Sept 13<br /> Storypath Ultra Draft Manuscript Preview 4 - Storyguide Advice - Coming Sept 18<br /> Storypath Ultra Draft Manuscript Preview 5 - Appendix A - Coming Sept 21<br /> Storypath Ultra Draft Manuscript Preview 6 - Pinfall From Grace - Coming Sept 23<br /> <br /> <b>S-F setting vote for Backers ( 11 days left ):</b><ul><li>Cyber-enhanced humans fly corporate-owned starships in search of new life and new financial opportunities.</li> <li>Futuristic superheroes fight interdimensional monsters in order to keep them from destabilizing reality.</li> <li>An experimental space flight flings the player characters into a distant galaxy full of strange and alien sights.</li> </ul>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-04T00:57:55-07:00","id":1541519,"title":"","content":"For now I have only one slighty nitpick for Basic Rules chapter - needless 3 times repetion on 'X Card' mechanics in playing advice. <b>I'm all for players comfort with game and 'table'</b> - but one this paragraph is really enough. Why write the same thing 3 times? \ud83e\udd14<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SP Ultra Preview 1</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Get Your Bearings</b><br /> When someone at the table is faced with something they\u2019re uncomfortable with, they can use the<br /> Bearings rules to adjust your game. The Bearings rules helps a person articulate when a game is going in<br /> a direction that makes them uncomfortable. These rules supersede all other rules in Storypath Ultra.<br /> <b>The Tap</b>: When you\u2019re starting to feel uncomfortable with what is happening in game, tap the table three<br /> times or type \u2026 in the chat. This alerts everyone to what is happening, but also tells them they can<br /> continue with play.<br /> T<b>he Knock: </b>When you\u2019re confronted with something that you don\u2019t want to participate in, knock on the<br /> table three times or type !!! in the chat. This tells the Storyguide to take over the scene and wrap it up,<br /> moving the game on to the next scene.<br /> <b>The Cut: </b>Place your hand down on the table and perform a slicing motion or type CUT in the chat in all<br /> capitals. This tells everyone to end the scene immediately and remove the scene from play. If you need it,<br /> you may speak to the group about how you feel and get the necessary support from your fellow players.<br /> The Storyguide can also call for a quick break to let everyone get a drink and relax with one another to<br /> cool off.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-10T11:44:26-07:00","id":1541877,"title":"","content":"We have a <b>Preview 2 - Expansion</b> - and Table of Content in it:<br /> <br /> <img width=\"209\" height=\"420\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OnLiSs4.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/OnLiSs4.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/OnLiSs4.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <img width=\"273\" height=\"417\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Rb4KSnK.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/Rb4KSnK.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/Rb4KSnK.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <img width=\"341\" height=\"426\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ICE1Ld6.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/ICE1Ld6.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/ICE1Ld6.png\" data-title=\"Click o